{"unit_id":"reimu-create__uiopt#feature-1","repo":"reimu-create/uiopt","commit":"7316d28d21840f0e2e7b24f7be3cd46004de5c31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"uiopt 的功能「余额与会话开销」：余额浮层显示账户余额、订阅用量、会话成本和 token 统计；DeepSeek 余额差会按会话持久累计，消息用量另可按模型计价。客户端定时请求宿主接口刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:737-811","lib/client.js:300-354"]}
{"unit_id":"reimu-create__uiopt#feature-2","repo":"reimu-create/uiopt","commit":"7316d28d21840f0e2e7b24f7be3cd46004de5c31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"uiopt 的功能「上下文占用环」：悬浮组件把当前会话已用 token 与模型上下文容量换算为占用百分比，并以圆环呈现；切换会话时读取对应会话数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:819-908","lib/client.js:67-134","lib/client.js:192-205"]}
{"unit_id":"reimu-create__uiopt#feature-3","repo":"reimu-create/uiopt","commit":"7316d28d21840f0e2e7b24f7be3cd46004de5c31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"uiopt 的功能「提供商图标」：输入框右侧显示当前模型提供商标识，包含 DeepSeek 自绘鲸鱼图标及 OpenCode Go 等提供商标记；模型选择变化时跟随更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:357-420","lib/client.js:779-787"]}
{"unit_id":"reimu-create__uiopt#feature-4","repo":"reimu-create/uiopt","commit":"7316d28d21840f0e2e7b24f7be3cd46004de5c31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"uiopt 的功能「额外插件管理与导入」：设置页的“额外插件”标签展示自主安装插件的状态和配置可编辑性，并允许选择 zip、tgz 或 tar.gz 包上传；宿主解包安装并添加挂载配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:572-707","lib/index.js:911-951","lib/index.js:953-1068"]}
{"unit_id":"reimu-create__uiopt#caveat-1","repo":"reimu-create/uiopt","commit":"7316d28d21840f0e2e7b24f7be3cd46004de5c31","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"uiopt 使用 DSH 凭据查询 DeepSeek 或 OpenCode Go 的账户信息，并向对应服务发送授权请求；浏览器通过同源宿主路由取结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:262-315","lib/index.js:737-811"]}
{"unit_id":"reimu-create__uiopt#caveat-2","repo":"reimu-create/uiopt","commit":"7316d28d21840f0e2e7b24f7be3cd46004de5c31","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"uiopt 将余额差累计状态写入 DSH profile 的 profiles/web/balance-state.json；会话消耗的余额差可能包含同一密钥下其他会话的扣费。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:71-90","lib/index.js:98-123"]}
